<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1490261238712762399 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1490261238712762399><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Sunday, April 5, 2026 12:06 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1490261238712762399>4/5/2026 12:06 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>B&#250;ri&#240; er ekki heimili &#254;itt <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128330;️"
    title="dove"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f54a.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127749;"
    title="sunrise"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f305.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#129718;"
    title="feather"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1fab6.svg"> 06/04/2025 - Ta&#237;land</strong>

&#201;g heyr&#240;i &#254;etta lag &#254;egar &#233;g gekk um marka&#240; &#237; Japan, bara venjulegur dagur… og &#254;a&#240; stoppa&#240;i mig &#237; sporum m&#237;num.

„Leyf&#240;u pl&#225;ssi a&#240; vaxa… b&#250;ri&#240; er ekki heimili &#254;itt.“

&#201;g var ekki einu sinni a&#240; leita a&#240; skilti, en Gu&#240; setti eitt beint fyrir framan mig.

„Sp&#246;rfuglinn“ eftir The Hunts spila&#240;i og or&#240;in sl&#243;gu dj&#250;pt — eins og himinninn hv&#237;sla&#240;i &#237; gegnum h&#225;va&#240;a heimsins.

Og jafnvel &#254;&#243;tt &#254;essi stund hafi gerst &#237; Japan, var &#254;etta myndband teki&#240; upp &#237; Phraya Nakhon hellinum — Prachuap Khiri Khan Ta&#237;landi — &#225; sta&#240; &#254;ar sem merking bo&#240;skaparins birtist &#237; raun og veru.

&#222;a&#240; minnti mig &#225; a&#240; Gu&#240; lei&#240;ir okkur oft &#254;essa lei&#240; — &#250;t &#250;r innilokun, &#250;t &#250;r &#243;tta, &#250;t &#250;r litlu r&#253;munum sem vi&#240; h&#246;fum lifa&#240; af &#237;…

Og inn &#237; eitthva&#240; st&#230;rra.

Brau&#240;mylsna &#237; einu landi.

Bylting &#237; &#246;&#240;ru.

Vi&#240; sm&#237;&#240;um b&#250;r &#250;r &#254;&#230;gindum, g&#246;mlum sj&#225;lfsmyndum, lifunarmynstrum ... en okkur var aldrei &#230;tla&#240; a&#240; vera loka&#240; inni.

B&#250;ri&#240; er ekki heimili &#254;itt.

Gef&#240;u &#254;&#233;r pl&#225;ss til a&#240; vaxa.
Breiddu &#250;t v&#230;ngi &#254;&#237;na.
Treystu &#225; lei&#240;ina.

„Sparrow“ eftir The Hunts — lag eftir indie-&#254;j&#243;&#240;lagad&#250;ettinn The Hunts, sem er a&#240; finna &#225; pl&#246;tunni Hibernating Heart. Myndatexti fr&#225; TikTok.

#TheHunts #TheSparrow #PhrayaNakhonCave ⁠thailand #PrachuapKhiriKhan #DivineSigns #FaithWalk #SpiritualJourney #BreakFree #YouWereMeantToFly #HealingPath #GodIsSpeaking #AwakenedSoul

