<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1511025310659776613 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1511025310659776613><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Monday, June 1, 2026 7:15 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1511025310659776613>6/1/2026 7:15 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Skeri&#240; me&#240; me&#240;vitund - ekki gleymsku <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="✂️"
    title="scissors"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2702.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128154;"
    title="green_heart"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f49a.svg"> 13/11/2025 - Tyrkland</strong>

Vi&#240; erum &#246;ll a&#240; klippa &#225; hverjum degi.
Hverri hugsun losnu&#240;.
Hverri tr&#250; losnu&#240;.
Hverri venju vaxin upp &#250;r.
&#222;annig er innri gar&#240;urinn m&#243;ta&#240;ur.

Skeri&#240; er ekki dau&#240;i eg&#243;sins.
&#222;a&#240; er greining -
a&#240; fjarl&#230;gja &#254;a&#240; sem b&#230;tt var vi&#240; me&#240; &#243;tta, skilyr&#240;um og erf&#240;um,
svo &#254;a&#240; sem er satt geti anda&#240; aftur.

Jes&#250;s sag&#240;i a&#240; r&#237;ki&#240; tilheyri b&#246;rnunum -
a&#240; styrkja &#225;setninginn um a&#240; losna vi&#240; skilyr&#240;in
sem voru aldrei &#254;&#237;n til a&#240; byrja me&#240;.

Vi&#240; s&#237;&#240;ustu kv&#246;ldm&#225;lt&#237;&#240;ina sag&#240;i Jes&#250;s:
„&#222;etta er l&#237;kami minn, gefinn fyrir y&#240;ur.“
&#222;etta var ekki fyrirm&#230;li um blinda endurtekningu,
heldur k&#246;llun til minningar -
til a&#240; koma &#237; veg fyrir a&#240; merking &#254;essarar tilveru hverfi.

Minning &#225;n n&#230;rveru er alls ekki minning.
Athafnir sem eru endurteknar &#225;n me&#240;vitundar hei&#240;ra ekki f&#243;rnina -
&#254;&#230;r gleyma henni.

&#222;egar vi&#240; snyrtum me&#240;vita&#240;,
verndum vi&#240; mikilv&#230;gasta hluta okkar sj&#225;lfra…
<img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127800;"
    title="cherry_blossom"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f338.svg"> innra barni&#240; —
ekki barnalegt,
heldur vakandi.

Hugsi&#240; gar&#240;inn ykkar me&#240; me&#240;vitund.

A&#240; endurtaka hringr&#225;sina &#225;n &#254;ess a&#240; skilja
er einfaldlega a&#240; hamla vexti ykkar.

