Engin leyfis&#254;&#246;rf.

Bara kyrrl&#225;tur kraftur &#254;ess a&#240; velja hvar &#254;&#250; hv&#237;list,
hven&#230;r &#254;&#250; hreyfir &#254;ig,
og hva&#240; &#254;&#250; verndar. <img
